%% State machine of a brief (Brief.review.status), as server/routes/staff.ts enforces it.
stateDiagram-v2
  direction LR
  [*] --> Draft : agents finish a run<br/>(brief.generated)
  Draft --> InReview : staff review the<br/>first statement
  InReview --> InReview : approve, edit or reject<br/>a statement (statement.reviewed)
  InReview --> Published : every statement reviewed<br/>and a reviewer named<br/>(brief.published)
  InReview --> InReview : publish refused (409)<br/>while any statement<br/>is unreviewed
  Published --> Draft : staff draft a new brief<br/>(the old file is kept in history)
  InReview --> Draft : staff draft a new brief
  Published --> Published : a later review is logged,<br/>status stays published

  Draft : Draft
  Draft : shown whole, labelled "Draft"
  InReview : In review
  InReview : still labelled draft to residents
  Published : Published
  Published : "Approved by (name), (date)"
  Published : rejected statements left out
  note right of Published
    Publish needs the staff passcode, a reviewer name
    and a decision on every statement. Each change is
    a new log entry with the brief's hash, and nothing
    earlier is overwritten.
  end note
